  "clothes-and-things": {
    "title": "Clothes and things",
    "summary": "物 has three readings: もの on its own and in native words like 食べ物, ぶつ in compounds like 名物, and もつ in a few, above all 荷物, luggage. 着 means both wear and arrive — 着る and 着く.",
