  "using-and-making": {
    "title": "Using and making",
    "summary": "切る, to cut, and 着る, to wear, are both きる, but 切る is godan and 着る ichidan: 切って, 着て. 方 is ほう for a direction or side, and かた for a person or a way of doing something (使い方).",
