  "health": {
    "title": "Health and the hospital",
    "summary": "元気 and 病気 are already N5 words. 元 is もと on its own, げん in 元気 and がん in 元日; 死ぬ is the only everyday verb ending in ぬ, so it alone shows that conjugation — 死んで, 死んだ.",
