  "power-and-motion": {
    "title": "Power and motion",
    "summary": "発 is はつ, but it shrinks to はっ before a k, s or h sound — 発見 はっけん, 発車 はっしゃ, 発表 はっぴょう — and after 出 it becomes ぱつ: 出発, しゅっぱつ. 力 is ちから on its own, りょく in most compounds and りき in a few, such as 人力車.",
    "words": {
      "力|ちから": ["Power", "Strength"],
      "努力|どりょく": ["Effort"],
